<title>UK: Mcalpine in bid talks with Raine.</title>
<headline>Mcalpine in bid talks with Raine.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>British construction group Alfred McAlpine Plc said on Monday that it is in talks that may lead to an offer for housebuilder Raine Plc.  </p>
<p>It said in a statement that any offer would be all share and would be at a slight premium to Raine's share price of 19.5p on April 21.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
